</WBK>
<BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/></TAB></TXT><BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Rods and Shapes Submittals</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>Submit a sample FRP bar,<MET> 300 mm</MET><ENG> 12 inches</ENG> long.</OLI><BRK/>
<OLI>Submit material property test reports indicating the following physical properties of the FRP bar or 
shape.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="2">Tensile strength, as determined in accordance with <RID>ASTM D3916</RID> for FRP rods or <RID>ASTM D3039/D3039M</RID>
 for flat or rectangular shaped FRP reinforcement.</OLI><BRK/>
<OLI LEVEL="2">Design elastic modulus by the strength and rupture strain values.  Determine ultimate tensile 
strength and rupture strain values by subtracting three standard deviations from the average 
values of 20 or more tensile tests.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Submit product data with documented evidence that the [rods][shapes] meet the requirements of Table 1.</OLI></OLG><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
</SPT><SPT><TTL><SUB>Structural [Paste][Adhesive] Material</SUB></TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL>Material Properties</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide structural [paste][adhesive] that conforms to the material properties listed in Table 2.</TXT><BRK/>
<TXT><TAB HEADERROWS="2">
